appropriate_all(V) => can_watch_without_guidance(V). @ "If a film is appropriate for people of all ages, then children can watch it without guidance from parents."
excessive_content(V) => not can_watch_without_guidance(V). @ "If a film contains excessive erotic and violent content, children cannot watch it without guidance from their parents."
rated_ga(V) => appropriate_all(V). @ "If a film is rated General Audience, then it is appropriate for people of all ages."
family_animated(V) => rated_ga(V). @ "All family-friendly animated films are rated General Audience."
frozen(V) => family_animated(V). @ "All movies in the Frozen series are family-friendly animated films."
film(hachi). @ "“Hachi: A dog’s Tale” is a film."
family_animated(hachi) | appropriate_all(hachi). @ "“Hachi: A dog’s Tale”  is either a family-friendly animated film or is appropriate for people of all ages."
? rated_ga(hachi).
